        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DK7356, Victorian Style Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Victorian Door Knocker is made solid brass and is available in 9 great finishes including satin nickel and oil rubbed bronze. It is thru-bolt mounted with 6-1/4\" center to center mounting holes (distance between the two mounting screw holes). It comes packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"316\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DK7356-Specifications.gif?v=1704354571\" width=\"316\" height=\"247\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DK7356 Victorian Style Door Knocker Specifications\">\r\n</tr>\r\n</td>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis front door knocker features a classic urn tip that will enhance traditional homes; but it is still timeless enough to look great in almost any setting while still adding a beautiful a functional finishing touch to your front door. It can even be engraved for a personal touch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DK7356 Victorian Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 6-1/4\" c.c. (distance between the 2 mounting screws)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Thru-Bolted (screws go thru the door)</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DK7356.pdf?v=1704262193\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DK7356 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Victorian Door Knocker, Deltana DK7356",
                "description": "Victorian Door Knocker Deltana DK7356 - This Victorian Door Knocker is made solid brass and is available in 9 great finishes including satin nickel and oil rubbed bronze. It is thru-bolt mounted with 6-1/4 inch center to center mounting holes (distance between the two mounting screw holes). It comes packaged with mounting hardware. This front door knocker features a classic urn tip that will enhance traditional homes; but it is still timeless enough to look great in almost any setting while still adding a beautiful a functional finishing touch to your front door. It can even be engraved for a personal personal touch.",
                "keywords": "DEL-DK7356 Victorian Door Knockers, Deltana  DK7356 Brass Victorian Door Knocker, victorian style knockers, door knockers, door knocker oil rubbed bronze, victorian style hardware, urn tip door knockers, classic door knockers, traditional door knockers,"
